CHAPTER 2: CHARACTERISTICS OF THE POPULATION
2.1 Socio-cultural characteristics of the population
2.1.1 Nationality of the population of Nyarugenge District
The results of the 5th RPHC-2022 indicate that the Rwandan population represent 99.11% and
foreigners represent 0.89% at national level. In the City of Kigali, foreigners represent 1.18%
and, in Nyarugenge District, foreigners represent 0.88% that is to say 3,276 residents
foreigners.
Three sectors of Nyarugenge District that have the highest percentage of foreigners
compared to others are Nyarugenge (4.32%), Rwezamenyo (2.70%) and Muhima (2.37%).
The table below illustrates the distribution of the population by nationality with their respective
sectors of residence.
